CRM is trained with a single objective:
\begin{equation}
  \mathcal{L} = \bigl\|\mathbf{a}^* - \mathbf{a}_{\mathrm{expert}}\bigr\|_2^2,
  \label{eq:crm_loss}
\end{equation}
